==Major League Baseball draft==
{{Main|2026 Major League Baseball draft}}

The 2026 Draft was held July 11–12, 2026. The Dodgers lost their second-, third-, fifth- and sixth-highest picks as a penalty for signing two players who had rejected qualifying offers. Their first pick was also dropped down 10 spots because they exceeded the second surcharge threshold of the Competitive Balance Tax.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.mlb.com/dodgers/news/dodgers-2026-draft-preview?t=mlb-pipeline-coverage|title=What will the Dodgers do with their limited number of Draft picks?|first=Sonja|last=Chen|website=[[MLB.com]] |date=July 8, 2026|access-date=July 10, 2026}}</ref> The picked 16 players in the draft.

